repository-code: "https://github.com/rybkagreenbelin-png/molecular-ai-research-notes"
abstract: >-
  Research notes of an open programme studying the continuously
  running learning process as the living mechanism of intelligence.
  A frozen transformer already carries five of six properties of
  living intelligence implicitly; the programme adds the sixth —
  temporal plasticity — through an external architecture of processes
  (salience triggers at the entrance, a typed graph of knowledge
  molecules with a lifecycle, sleep-cycle consolidation into LoRA,
  an observer on mid-layer activations, language shelves).
keywords:
  - continual-learning
  - memory
  - agents
  - complementary-learning-systems
  - research-notes
